# NeuroTrade
#
# The repo is a monorepo that will span Python, Go and TypeScript. Only Python
# exists today; the other sections are here so nothing slips through when api/
# and ui/ land in Phase 3.

# ── Local planning docs (Notion is the source of truth) ──────
TRADER_PLAN.md
MARKET_RESEARCH.md

# ── Secrets & machine-local config ───────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
config/local/
config/*.local.yaml
ibkr_credentials*
.ib_*

# ═════════════════════════ Python ════════════════════════════
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
*.egg
.eggs/

# Environments. uv.lock IS committed — research runs must be reproducible.
.venv/
venv/
.uv/

